"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["48412"],{613382(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":12005,"title":"\u5B66\u672F\u7ED8\u56FE","description":"Generate a clean, professional academic framework diagram on a pure white background, strictly following NeurIPS 2025 visual conventions. \\n\\nStyle & Palette: Agent-narrative aesthetic. Use soft pastel, scientific color palettes (muted tones of pale blue, sea-green, light lavender, and pale amber). Strictly avoid overly saturated or eye-burning primary colors. Use clean black outlines and minimal gradients.\\n\\nVisual Semantics: \\n- Data/Storage: Use cylinders.\\n- Processing/Modules: Use rounded rectangles.\\n- Tensors/Features/Data Flows: Use grids.\\n- Complex representations: Use stacked layers.\\n- Status Icons: Integrate minimal academic icons organically (\u{1F525} for trainable components, \u2744\uFE0F for frozen models, \u{1F50D} for retrieval mechanisms, \u{1F9E0} for memory).\\n\\nContent & Layout Detail (Strictly ordered by spatial data flow):\\n1. Top Section (Data Input): Left is a cylinder \\"\u98CE\u9669\u539F\u59CB\u65E5\u5FD7\\" feeding into a rounded rectangle \\"\u6570\u636E\u5904\u7406 (\u2744\uFE0F)\\". This outputs a grid \\"\u8F68\u8FF9\u6570\u636E\u6D41\\", which flows right into a bar chart \\"\u6307\u6807\u53CD\u9988\\" (Precision, Recall, F1).\\n2. Left Middle Section (Representation Learning): A container labeled \\"\u5BF9\u6BD4\u6837\u672C\u6784\u5EFA\\". Inside, stacked layers \\"\u6B63\u6837\u672C\u5BF9\u751F\u6210\\" and \\"\u56F0\u96BE\u8D1F\u91C7\u6837\\" flow into a rounded rectangle \\"\u79CD\u5B50\u6316\u6398 (\u{1F50D})\\". This interacts with a cylinder \\"\u9ED1\u79CD\u5B50\u8F68\u8FF9\u8868\\".\\n3. Right Middle Section (Multi-Agent Analyzer): A large main rounded rectangle container \\"\u534F\u4F5C\u591A\u667A\u80FD\u4F53\u5206\u6790\u5668\\". Inside, top left is a globe/network icon for \\"\u5168\u5C40\u4E0A\u4E0B\u6587\u4E0E\u77E5\u8BC6\u5E93\\". Top right are three agent icons: \\"\u591A\u6837\u6027\u667A\u80FD\u4F53\\", \\"\u89C4\u5219\u4F18\u5316\u667A\u80FD\u4F53 (\u{1F525})\\", \\"\u4E13\u5BB6\u77E5\u8BC6\u667A\u80FD\u4F53\\". Below them are two sub-modules: \\"\u8BB0\u5FC6\u7CFB\u7EDF (\u{1F9E0})\\" and \\"\u4EBA\u5DE5\u89C4\u5219\u6307\u5BFC\\". The container outputs right to a monitor icon \\"\u9274\u522B\u4E0E\u586B\u8865\u6307\u5BFC\\".\\n4. Bottom Left Section (Storage & Retrieval): Cylinders and grids for \\"\u9ED1\u79CD\u5B50\u8F68\u8FF9\u5B58\u50A8\\" and \\"\u7279\u5F81\u5B58\u50A8\u8868\\" feed into a large rounded rectangle \\"\u5927\u89C4\u6A21\u5411\u91CF\u68C0\u7D22 (\u{1F50D})\\".\\n5. Bottom Right Section (Training & Deployment): An arrow \\"\u89C4\u5219\u53D1\u73B0\u77E5\u8BC6\\" flows from retrieval into a rounded rectangle \\"\u6A21\u578B\u8BAD\u7EC3\u4E0E\u89C4\u5219\u53D1\u73B0\u7CFB\u7EDF (\u{1F525})\\". This flows into \\"\u6027\u80FD\u8BC4\u4F30\\" (which has a feedback loop back to the multi-agent analyzer), and finally outputs to a monitor icon \\"\u7EBF\u4E0A\u68C0\u6D4B (\u{1F525})\\" and a cylinder \\"\u90E8\u7F72\\".\\n\\nTypography & Clarity: Keep all Chinese text labels minimalistic, highly legible, and properly aligned. Ensure clear, orthogonal black arrows indicating complex data flows and feedback loops. Avoid visual clutter, ensuring rigorous academic structural alignment.","owner":"\u674E\u7389\u5947","upvotes":3,"downvotes":0,"upvoteDifference":3,"updatedAt":"2026-04-14T19:27:34.071Z"}')}}]);